  "notes": "Adds a separate flashlight environment path with independent ambient/range validity and operator-referenced per-SPAD software compensation. Phone TIRAS Service 0.1.214 provides a BLE Test at a declared approximately 1000 mm matte surface; fit and held-out checks plus CRC-protected private NVS save determine success. Rejected or ambiguous distance remains unknown. Calibration starts only in device Settings and blocks generation until it finishes. No TinyML guess, no sensor register/profile or Smoke filter change. Retains dark AND valid near-surface gates, hysteresis, dwell and smooth sleep/hibernate fades. Trace schema 2 retains raw and corrected observations, and starts one new Auto recorder session for this firmware without erasing prior records. Includes existing approved LED/current/Wi-Fi fixes. Physical near/far accuracy and Auto operation require user calibration and field verification; software build does not prove hardware acceptance. User installs through Wi-Fi. Charger diagnostic remains paused.",
